// {R} 1/1: "{T}: choose new targets for target spell." Modeled on the
// tap-pinger shape (Creature tap-activated DealDamage AnyTarget.ron) and the
// CopySpell fixture, but re-targeting a COMMITTED stack entry via
// `Action::Retarget` ([CR#707.10c,115.7d]) instead of minting a copy — the
// engine-copy-spells end-to-end fixture for `Retarget`. `mode: ChooseNew`
// is [CR#115.7d]'s own mode (leave-any-even-if-illegal); mode-specific
// semantics are unwired this task (grammar only).
Normal(
    name: "Creature tap-activated Retarget Target Spell",
    mana_cost: [Red],
    types: [Creature],
    power: 1,
    toughness: 1,
    abilities: [
        Activated(cost: [Tap], effect: Targeted(targets: [TargetOne(Kind(Spell))], effect: Retarget(mode: ChooseNew, of: Target(0), by: You))),
    ],
)
